         "text": "Reversing the limits, \\( g(x) = -\\int_{3}^{\\sqrt{x}} \\left(t^{3} + 1\\right) \\, dt \\), so by the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus its derivative is minus the integrand evaluated at \\( \\sqrt{x} \\).",
